{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/deployment/alchemy","title":"Alchemy provider","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"alchemy-provider","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy provider"}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"Experimental — validate in a non-production account first","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This provider is the least validated part of the deployment tooling. The"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"presets, the plan, the credential checks and the refusal paths are covered by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"tests through a runtime port, so what CraftTS "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"decides"}]},{"t":"text","text":" is verified."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What is "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"not"}]},{"t":"text","text":" verified is the last hop: the adapter that invokes Alchemy's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"current CLI has never run against a real Cloudflare or AWS account from this"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"repository. Treat your first deployment as the validation of that adapter —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"run "},{"t":"code","text":"deploy preview"},{"t":"text","text":" first and read the plan."}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/deploy-alchemy"},{"t":"text","text":" deploys a CraftTS manifest to Cloudflare or AWS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"through "},{"t":"link","href":"https://alchemy.run","external":true,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy"}]},{"t":"text","text":". It is an optional package: Alchemy"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"never appears in the dependencies of a CraftTS application, and a project that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"publishes a static artefact somewhere else never installs it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy is a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"provider of infrastructure"}]},{"t":"text","text":", not a runtime. It can create the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"resources, the bindings, the permissions and the state, where a publication"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"provider only uploads an artefact. Both read the same manifest."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"install","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Install"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"install","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--save-dev","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/deploy-alchemy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"alchemy","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The CLI resolves "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/deploy-<name>"},{"t":"text","text":" from the project being deployed, so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nothing else has to be configured. A provider living elsewhere is pointed at"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with "},{"t":"code","text":"--provider-module"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"credentials","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Credentials"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Credentials are read from the environment. The tooling checks that they are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"set, never reads their value beyond that, and never writes one to disk."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Platform"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Variables"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"cloudflare"}],[{"t":"code","text":"CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN"},{"t":"text","text":" (or "},{"t":"code","text":"CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY"},{"t":"text","text":"), "},{"t":"code","text":"CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID"},{"t":"text","text":" (or "},{"t":"code","text":"ALCHEMY_PROFILE"},{"t":"text","text":")"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"aws"}],[{"t":"code","text":"AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID"},{"t":"text","text":" (or "},{"t":"code","text":"AWS_PROFILE"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"AWS_ROLE_ARN"},{"t":"text","text":"), "},{"t":"code","text":"AWS_REGION"},{"t":"text","text":" (or "},{"t":"code","text":"AWS_DEFAULT_REGION"},{"t":"text","text":")"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy 2 uses its provider state store and profile configuration. The adapter"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"does not require the legacy "},{"t":"code","text":"ALCHEMY_PASSWORD"},{"t":"text","text":" variable."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"state-and-stages","children":[{"t":"text","text":"State and stages"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy reconciles against a recorded state, which is what lets a preview tell"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a creation from an update. Every resource name carries the application "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"and"}]},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the stage:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"demo-production-worker"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"demo-preview-42-worker"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A stage is passed with "},{"t":"code","text":"--stage"},{"t":"text","text":"; it defaults to the "},{"t":"code","text":"environment"},{"t":"text","text":" of the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"manifest. Two stages never share a resource, so a preview deployment cannot"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"overwrite production."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"preview-before-mutating","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Preview before mutating"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"deploy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"preview","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--provider","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"alchemy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--stage","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"staging","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"plan: alchemy → stage staging (2 resource(s))"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  create    cloudflare:KV.Namespace demo-staging-sessions"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    binding: SESSIONS"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  update    cloudflare:Worker demo-staging-worker"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    entrypoint: dist/apps/demo/worker.js"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    assets: dist/apps/demo"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  note: Alchemy 2.0.0-beta.76, stage `staging`."}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"Preview only: nothing was created, updated or deleted."}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The preview opens Alchemy in its read phase, so it resolves the recorded state"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and creates nothing. A resource Alchemy still records that the manifest no"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"longer declares appears as "},{"t":"code","text":"delete"},{"t":"text","text":": hiding it would understate the change."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"deploy","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Deploy"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft-ts","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"deploy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--provider","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"alchemy","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--stage","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"staging","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"deploy"},{"t":"text","text":" runs, in order: the manifest check, the provider check (credentials,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"artefacts, presets), then the same preview. It refuses to apply until "},{"t":"code","text":"--yes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"approves the plan, and reports "},{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_DEPLOY_NOT_CONFIRMED"},{"t":"text","text":" otherwise."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Outputs are printed as "},{"t":"code","text":"<resource>.<key>"},{"t":"text","text":", and the first "},{"t":"code","text":"url"},{"t":"text","text":" output becomes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the deployment URL:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"url: https://demo-staging.workers.dev"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"output demo-staging-sessions.id: 5f1c…"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"output demo-staging-worker.url: https://demo-staging.workers.dev"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"Deployed to stage `staging` with alchemy."}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"--json"},{"t":"text","text":" to get "},{"t":"code","text":"{ applied, plan, result, diagnostics }"},{"t":"text","text":" for a CI step."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-each-manifest-becomes","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What each manifest becomes"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Manifest"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Resources"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"static"},{"t":"text","text":" on "},{"t":"code","text":"cloudflare"}],[{"t":"code","text":"Website.StaticSite"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"worker"},{"t":"text","text":" on "},{"t":"code","text":"cloudflare"}],[{"t":"text","text":"binding resources, then "},{"t":"code","text":"Worker"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"static"},{"t":"text","text":" on "},{"t":"code","text":"aws"}],[{"t":"code","text":"Website.StaticSite"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"lambda"},{"t":"text","text":" on "},{"t":"code","text":"aws"}],[{"t":"code","text":"Lambda.Function"},{"t":"text","text":" with its built-in Function URL"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"node"},{"t":"text","text":" on "},{"t":"code","text":"aws"}],[{"t":"text","text":"refused; use the Docker provider or an image preset"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Bindings map to the resource their "},{"t":"code","text":"type"},{"t":"text","text":" names — "},{"t":"code","text":"kv"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"r2"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"d1"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"queue"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"durable_object"},{"t":"text","text":". A binding typed "},{"t":"code","text":"secret"},{"t":"text","text":" is never created: its value must"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"already exist in the Alchemy state or the environment, and the plan says so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"instead of carrying it. Any other type is refused with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"CRAFT_DEPLOY_PROVIDER_UNSUPPORTED_RESOURCE"},{"t":"text","text":" rather than silently dropped."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The Function URL keeps the "},{"t":"code","text":"{ id, input, context }"},{"t":"text","text":" protocol of a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"server-function, so the same function behaves as it does locally."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"rollback","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Rollback"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy has no \"undo\": a rollback is a deployment of the previous artefact."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Check out the commit whose artefact was healthy, or restore its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"dist/<app>/craft-deployment-manifest.json"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Rebuild it: the manifest is byte-identical for a given input, so a rebuild"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of the same commit produces the same declaration."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"npx craft-ts deploy preview --provider alchemy --stage <stage>"},{"t":"text","text":" and read"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the plan: a rollback shows "},{"t":"code","text":"update"},{"t":"text","text":" on the resources that moved forward."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Apply it with "},{"t":"code","text":"--yes"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two things do not roll back on their own and have to be handled explicitly: a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"resource deleted by a finalize is recreated empty, and a stateful binding such"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"as a KV namespace or a bucket keeps the data written by the newer version."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Roll a stateful change back through the data, not through the deployment."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-stays-in-craftts-what-is-delegated","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What stays in CraftTS, what is delegated"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"CraftTS owns the manifest, the checks, the resolved artefact and the plan"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"shape. It decides "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"what"}]},{"t":"text","text":" has to exist, and it refuses to deploy a manifest that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"does not pass "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts check"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy owns the resources, the state, the credentials handling and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reconciliation. It decides "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"how"}]},{"t":"text","text":" what CraftTS declared comes to exist."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The adapter generates a temporary Alchemy 2 stack and invokes the installed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy CLI. "},{"t":"code","text":"ALCHEMY_RESOURCE_EXPORTS"},{"t":"text","text":" maps each planned resource type to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"current module and nested export used in that generated stack."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"limits","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Limits"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The adapter over the Alchemy API has never run against a live account, as"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stated at the top of this page."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The Fargate fallback runs the artefact as a container: the image build stays"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"outside CraftTS."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Alchemy has no preset here for the platforms a publication provider already"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"covers ("},{"t":"code","text":"vercel"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"netlify"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"firebase"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"github-pages"},{"t":"text","text":")."}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"install","text":"Install"},{"level":2,"id":"credentials","text":"Credentials"},{"level":2,"id":"state-and-stages","text":"State and stages"},{"level":2,"id":"preview-before-mutating","text":"Preview before mutating"},{"level":2,"id":"deploy","text":"Deploy"},{"level":2,"id":"what-each-manifest-becomes","text":"What each manifest becomes"},{"level":2,"id":"rollback","text":"Rollback"},{"level":2,"id":"what-stays-in-craftts-what-is-delegated","text":"What stays in CraftTS, what is delegated"},{"level":2,"id":"limits","text":"Limits"}]}